OL,3,ADemocrats outline aims for Congress
OL,4,Aafter midterm wins, as Trump weighs in
OL,5,Aon knife-edge Alaska vote
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt comes as a top Democrat says
OL,8,FCongress will rein in "an
OL,9,Fout-of-control executive branch" after
OL,10,Fhis party won control of both houses in
OL,11,Fthe midterm elections
OL,13,FHakeem Jeffries - likely to be the next
OL,14,FSpeaker of the House - accuses the
OL,15,F"Trump Cartel" of "massive corruption"
OL,16,Fand adds: "We are going to hold the
OL,17,Fcrooks accountable"
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/40
