OL,3,AParaguay President Santiago Pena
OL,4,Aresigns after bank collapse
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe crisis erupted after Ueno Bank
OL,7,Fentered an insolvency process, which
OL,8,Ffroze all operations. Lawmakers accused
OL,9,FPena, who was a shareholder until last
OL,10,Fyear in the company that owned the
OL,11,Fbank, of conflicts of interest and
OL,12,Fmisconduct.
OL,14,FPena has rejected suggestions of
OL,15,Fimpropriety. His resignation comes
OL,16,Fafter Paraguay's lower house of
OL,17,Fcongress voted in favour of pursuing an
OL,18,Fimpeachment trial.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/40
